---
/** Contact: a mailto link only (owner decision 2026-10-18). The site has no form and sends nothing. */
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHead from "@hllmr/brand/components/PageHead.astro";
import { DIVISION_SITES, mailto } from "@hllmr/portfolio";
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, LINKS } from "../../lib/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact · HLLMR Ventures"
  description="Contact HLLMR Ventures and its divisions by email: partnerships, projects, business systems, bookings and questions."
  sheet="Contact"
>
  <PageHead dwg="Contact" title="Start with an email" />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap grid">
      <div class="prose">
        <p class="big"><a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a></p>
        <p>A few lines are enough. It helps to know:</p>
        <p>The subject line tells us which part of HLLMR it is for:</p>
        <ul class="subjects">
          {
            DIVISION_SITES.map((d) => (
              <li>
                <a href={mailto(d.subject)}>{d.subject}</a> <span>· {d.key === "vntrs" ? "the company, partnerships, anything else" : d.name}</span>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
        <p>In the message, it helps to know:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>what you have in mind, and any dates that matter;</li>
          <li>what a good outcome would look like for you.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>A person reads every message and replies from the same address.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="note">
        <p class="anno">Note</p>
        <p>
          This site has no form and sends nothing. The link above opens your own mail program. For open-source projects,
          issues and discussions on <a href={LINKS.github} rel="noopener">GitHub</a> are welcome too.
        </p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .subjects span {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.6fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(24px, 5vw, 72px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .big {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 0.9rem + 1.6vw, 2rem) !important;
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .prose li::marker {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .note {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-top: 2px solid var(--text);
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 14px 18px;
  }
  .note p:last-child {
    margin: var(--space-2) 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
